Z||000003||bHooper||05-14-2001||09:14 AM||||oooooh niiiiiiiccceee<P>i cant wait to see this one of a kind automobile in person!<P>Doug, I've said it b4, and I'll say it again... your too nice!  But I like ya anyway  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>hoop||||reg||1
Z||000004||Cheever2||05-14-2001||10:51 AM||||Doug, I'm really sorry I laughed when you called me as you passed through on your way back.  It was a reaction of complete shock, at the inconceivable discouragement it must have been to have TWO such disappointments after driving all that way and taking all that time.  Outrageous.  I am terribly sorry it happened to you.  <P>I haven't even called the Houston guy, since you gave me his number.  I wasn't sure what I might say to him.  So, he really has an INDY?  Maybe I'll check it out after all.<P>Obsession, huh?  Maybe that's what I've got.  Thanks for the philosophy, you may have opened my eyes.<P><BR>||||reg||4
