Z||000007||LT1 Chop Top||05-14-2001||08:14 PM||||If there was an Indy Fiero to be found in San Antonio, it would have been ever so quickly picked up by the Alamo Area Fiero Owners club president in a heart beat.  His collection is around 25+ Fieros (some are sliders).<BR>If you want a car looked at in the future in the San Antonio area, the AAFO would be happy to check it out for you.  We are fortunate to have a great group of guys that will go out of their way to help a fellow Fiero fanatic!||||reg||1
